    Emdee's application shell — the collapsible icon rail, the frameless custom
    title bar, the sliding preferences drawer and the general QSS approach — is
    derived from the PyDracula template. The template targets PySide6; Emdee is
    an independent PyQt6 reimplementation of those interface patterns. The Qt
    Designer ``.ui`` files and the ``.qrc`` resource system were not carried
    over (``pyrcc6`` does not exist for PyQt6), and no template source file is
    redistributed verbatim.

